# WoW Chat 2 - Vision Document

## What This Is

A game to play with friends while talking. Fight monsters, find treasure, explore
forgotten deserts, do quests, find equipment. Sometimes with friends, sometimes
solo with AI companions. The difficulty scales with your group - team up and face
proportionally harder challenges.

This is the resurrection of wow-chat-1, which is now ancient history (at least
one whole year old). We miss it dearly.

## Core Experience

### The Roguelike Layer

Built on top of WoW, a survival-style game loop:

| Timer | Event | Description |
|-------|-------|-------------|
| 40s | Ambush | Level-appropriate monsters spawn and chase you |
| 130s | Travellers | Friendly NPCs wander the world |
| 100s | Treasure | Chests spawn nearby (scaled dungeon/raid loot) |

**Rest Mechanic**: Sit down and enemies orbit instead of attacking. A moment
to breathe, strategize, or just chat.

**Group Scaling**: Solo play spawns regular mobs. Group up and face rare elites.
The challenge grows with your party.

### Playerbots - Core Feature

AI companions are not optional extras - they're central to the experience:

- **Solo play**: Bots fill your party when friends aren't around
- **Scriptable behavior**: Custom AI through Lua scripting
- **Always available**: No waiting for friends to log on

Future: Explore computerized personality. What happens when bots have character?

## Technical Foundation

### Server Stack
- **AzerothCore**: WotLK (3.3.5a) emulator, Playerbot-enabled fork
- **Eluna**: LuaJIT scripting for game logic
- **MySQL**: Local installation, database changes tracked in git

### Key Modules
- **mod-playerbots**: AI companions (core feature, scriptable)
- **mod-eluna**: Lua scripting engine
- **mod-aoe-loot**: Quality-of-life looting
- **mod-grownup**: Level scaling

### The Soul (src/lua/)

The Lua scripts ARE the game. Everything custom lives here:

```
src/lua/
├── periodic_events.lua  # Main loop - ties everything together
├── ambush.lua           # Enemy spawning and combat
├── treasure.lua         # Chest spawning (dungeons, raids, dinosaur bones)
├── travel.lua           # NPC traveller system
├── movement.lua         # Position calculations
├── tempo.lua            # Game pacing
└── wow-chat-survival/
    └── waves.lua.vision # Future: Risk of Rain 2 style wave system
```

## Design Principles

1. **Play with friends** - The "chat" in wow-chat is socializing, not a system
2. **Scriptable everything** - Custom behavior in Lua, not C++
3. **Track the world** - Database changes version controlled, history preserved
4. **Isolation** - Self-contained project, doesn't pollute system
5. **Data separation** - Generation separate from viewing

## Directory Structure

```
wow-chat-2/
├── src/lua/            # THE SOUL - game scripts, fully tracked
├── mysql/
│   ├── databases/      # TRACKED - custom world data
│   └── conf/           # MySQL configuration
├── docs/               # Documentation
├── notes/              # Vision and design notes
├── issues/             # Issue tracking
├── scripts/            # Build and maintenance
├── installed-files/    # Server binaries (gitignored)
├── data-files/         # Client extracts (gitignored, too large)
