```

## Goals

### Phase 1: Foundation
- Playable server (the completion criterion)
- Lua scripts migrated and working
- Local MySQL with tracked database
- Playerbots operational

### Future Phases
- Bot behavior scripting
- Wave-based survival mode (waves.lua.vision)
- Data export and analysis
- AI integration (undefined but anticipated)

## Non-Goals

- Public server hosting
- Client modifications
- Exact retail replication
- Product - this is about software design

## The Promise

Raise more than one. Pick the purest, truest one.
